From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: folia-linear-build <folia-linear-build@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Linear region observability

Lock-free folder-wide timing and measurement counters for the Linear
read/write/flush/load paths. No behaviour change on the ANVIL path;
no hot-interface signature changes; no synchronized added on hot
record paths (LongAdder/LongAccumulator only); no Bukkit lookups; no
new threads; micros via System.nanoTime/1000.

Timing groups (count/total/max/avg) for read, write, flush and load,
plus markDirty, filesFlushed, failures, oversizeRejects, evicts,
cacheHits/cacheMisses and dirtyDepth. Measurement fields add summed
raw vs compressed flush bytes, bucketed flush p50/p99 latency
estimates (10 buckets, 1ms..1s+, upper-bound estimates, clean-no-op
flushes excluded like flush.count) and millis-since-last-successful-
flush (-1 when never flushed). Counters live folder-wide on the
coordinator with per-file views; RegionFileStorage delegates to the
coordinator and holds zero new fields.
---
